What this covers
----------------

Everything under `uebungen/` — exercise texts (`AUFGABE.md`), check
definitions (`exercise.toml`), and any material shipped with an exercise. The
same licence covers `trainer/` (see `trainer/LICENSE`).

The runner in `runner/` is licensed differently: MIT OR Apache-2.0, see
`LICENSE-MIT` and `LICENSE-APACHE`.

You may
-------

  - use these exercises in your own teaching, including inside an institution,
  - copy, translate and adapt them,
  - build further modules on this format,

as long as you

  - name the source (attribution),
  - do not use them commercially,
  - publish adaptations under the same licence (ShareAlike).

Suggested attribution:

    Übungen aus „Werkbank“ von Sebastian Kern,
    https://github.com/SebastianKrn/werkbank, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

Not covered
-----------

  - Solutions. They are not part of this repository (see CLAUDE.md rule 6).
  - Third-party material referenced under `vertiefung`. Those links point at
    Microsoft Learn, CompTIA and similar sources, which carry their own terms.
    Werkbank links to them and never reproduces them.
  - Examination documents of any training institution. None are contained here.

Content note: all example data (company names, hostnames, file contents) is
invented for teaching purposes. Any resemblance to a real organisation is
coincidental.
